id: vector_stats
category: collections
difficulty: 2
libs: gen_collect
checker: exact
timeout: 10
--- prompt
Write an Objeck program that stores the integers 4, 8, 15, 16, 23, 42 in a Collection Vector (the generic vector from the collection library, holding IntRef) and prints one line in exactly this form, computing both values from the vector:

sum=108 max=42
--- expected
sum=108 max=42
--- reference
use Collection;

class VectorStats {
	function : Main(args : String[]) ~ Nil {
		values := Vector->New()<IntRef>;
		each(v in [4, 8, 15, 16, 23, 42]) {
			values->AddBack(v);
		};

		sum := 0;
		max := 0;
		each(i : values) {
			value := values->Get(i)->Get();
			sum += value;
			if(value > max) {
				max := value;
			};
		};
		"sum={$sum} max={$max}"->PrintLine();
	}
}
